---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "Puppy Foundations San Jacinto | Good Doggos";
const description = "Set your puppy up for success in San Jacinto. We build neutrality and clear communication from day one using a balanced approach that nurtures and sets boundaries.";

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "Puppy Foundations Training",
  "description": description,
  "provider": {
    "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    "name": "Good Doggos",
    "url": "https://gooddoggos.com",
    "telephone": "+19514016252",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "San Jacinto",
      "addressRegion": "CA",
      "addressCountry": "US"
    }
  },
  "areaServed": {
    "@type": "AdministrativeArea",
    "name": "Riverside County"
  },
  "url": "https://gooddoggos.com/services/puppy-foundations"
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Hero Band -->
  <section class="bg-primary-navy pt-32 pb-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-body text-white/50 mt-6 mb-4" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="text-accent-gold hover:text-accent-gold/80 underline font-semibold">Home</a>
        <span>&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/pet-trainer" class="text-accent-gold hover:text-accent-gold/80 underline font-semibold">Pet Trainer</a>
        <span>&rsaquo;</span>
        <span class="text-white/80 truncate">Puppy Foundations</span>
      </nav>

      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6">
        Puppy Foundations in San Jacinto
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Body Content -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 bg-[#FCF9FA]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div class="prose max-w-none">
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          If you’ve just brought home a new puppy and your rugs are taking a beating, you’re in the "land shark" phase. Those sharp teeth are no joke, and neither is the frustration of trying to get a 10-week-old ball of energy to pay attention in the San Jacinto heat.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          These early struggles are symptoms of a need for structure and clear communication from day one. Because we are professionals, we do not guess or hand out generic puppy advice. We must evaluate your pup in person to set the right foundations before bad habits become permanent adult behaviors. Letting them "be puppies" without structure is how you end up with an out-of-control dog.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-primary-navy mt-12 mb-6">
          Building Success from Day One
        </h2>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          At Good Doggos, I don’t believe puppies are too young for clear communication. For 8 years, I’ve shown Riverside County owners that "balanced" training for puppies is about setting the stage for neutrality. I use heavy rewards (food, toys, praise) to build engagement, but I also introduce boundaries early. If you only ever teach them "yes," they’ll have a meltdown the first time life tells them they can't do something.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          I remember a puppy "land shark" that was biting children in a local home. By establishing boundaries early—using age-appropriate structure and a firm, fair "no"—we stopped the behavior before it became an ingrained habit. I even used my stable pack, Chico and Rocky, as puppy-safe role models to show the pup how a balanced dog behaves. Chico, my "Icebreaker," is perfect for teaching pups that they don't have to be frantic to get attention.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6">
          We don’t just stay in your living room. I’ll show you how to expose your pup to the sounds of the Ramona Expressway and Valley-Wide Recreation without overwhelming them. By the time they hit adolescence, your dog won't be looking for trouble; they’ll be looking to you for direction.
        </p>
        <p class="text-secondary-slate leading-[1.8] font-body text-[16px] mb-6 font-bold">
          Start building the dog of your dreams today. Apply for a Free Behavioral Assessment.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     CTA BAND
══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#FBF1E9]" style="border-top: 1px solid #E6DAC6;">
  <div class="w-full h-[3px]" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, #0F6D72, #D1B27F, #0F6D72);"></div>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 md:py-24 text-center">
    <p class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase mb-4" style="color: rgba(15,109,114,0.60);">Your Dog Is Next</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4" style="color: #0B2744;">
      Ready to See What's Possible?<br/>
      <span class="headline-accent" style="color: #D1B27F; font-style: italic; font-weight: 700;">Start With a Free Assessment.</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base mb-10 max-w-lg mx-auto" style="color: rgba(17,32,50,0.60);">
      Tell us about your dog. We'll do an honest assessment and point you toward the right program — or tell you if we're not the right fit.
    </p>
    <a href="/apply"
       class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
       style="background: #D1B27F; color: #0B2744; padding: 18px 44px; box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(209,178,127,0.35);">
      Apply for Free Behavioral Assessment →
    </a>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs" style="color: rgba(17,32,50,0.40);">Takes less than 3 minutes · No commitment required</p>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>
